    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/686b163229171cf9797cfc6ac985b065.avif?t=1749239770\" /></span><strong>Unit Down Charge is a futuristic action rail-shooter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed, and full of quirky character dialogues, unique level designs, fully animated story cutscenes, and challenging boss battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/73cfd614c252ad5b83e0ce208c338783.poster.avif?t=1749239770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/73cfd614c252ad5b83e0ce208c338783.webm?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/73cfd614c252ad5b83e0ce208c338783.mp4?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unit Down Charge combines:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arcade difficulty of a <strong>Cabal Shooter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level-based progression of a <strong>Rail Shooter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... both in one package!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/6e60a75a3c1e75bac55a3226659cc651.poster.avif?t=1749239770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/6e60a75a3c1e75bac55a3226659cc651.webm?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/6e60a75a3c1e75bac55a3226659cc651.mp4?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive arcade-styled shooting and dodging! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character swap-out mechanic! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced dialogue! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated in-game cutscenes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and intense boss battles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story that you can skip if you hate the dev! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/029a44a16378b98769c86e326008f64c.poster.avif?t=1749239770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/029a44a16378b98769c86e326008f64c.webm?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/029a44a16378b98769c86e326008f64c.mp4?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THANK YOU FOR YOUR SUPPORT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer that just wants this game to be the best it can be.\u00a0 If you have suggestions, I am always open ears, and have a Pinned suggestion discussion on the community page!<br><br>For business inquiries, you can reach me via Email:<br>randy@properdev.info<br><br>Thank you!\u00a0 Your kind words are a fuel I cannot replace, and I appreciate you all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/686b163229171cf9797cfc6ac985b065.avif?t=1749239770\" /></span><strong>Unit Down Charge is a futuristic action rail-shooter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed, and full of quirky character dialogues, unique level designs, fully animated story cutscenes, and challenging boss battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/73cfd614c252ad5b83e0ce208c338783.poster.avif?t=1749239770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/73cfd614c252ad5b83e0ce208c338783.webm?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/73cfd614c252ad5b83e0ce208c338783.mp4?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unit Down Charge combines:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arcade difficulty of a <strong>Cabal Shooter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level-based progression of a <strong>Rail Shooter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... both in one package!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/6e60a75a3c1e75bac55a3226659cc651.poster.avif?t=1749239770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/6e60a75a3c1e75bac55a3226659cc651.webm?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/6e60a75a3c1e75bac55a3226659cc651.mp4?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive arcade-styled shooting and dodging! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character swap-out mechanic! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced dialogue! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated in-game cutscenes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and intense boss battles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story that you can skip if you hate the dev! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/029a44a16378b98769c86e326008f64c.poster.avif?t=1749239770\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/029a44a16378b98769c86e326008f64c.webm?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509660/extras/029a44a16378b98769c86e326008f64c.mp4?t=1749239770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THANK YOU FOR YOUR SUPPORT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer that just wants this game to be the best it can be.\u00a0 If you have suggestions, I am always open ears, and have a Pinned suggestion discussion on the community page!<br><br>For business inquiries, you can reach me via Email:<br>randy@properdev.info<br><br>Thank you!\u00a0 Your kind words are a fuel I cannot replace, and I appreciate you all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
